 <h3><u>Ya Mustafa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya Mustafa..(4)<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n<br> Mohammad mustafa</p> 
  <p>Badr-ud-duja, shams-uz-zuha, khair-ul-wara, Ya Mustafa<br> Ya mustafa...<br> Badr-ud-duja, shams-uz-zuha, khair-ul-wara, Ya Mustafa</p> 
  <p>Aaya zamee'n pe to qur'aan laya<br> duniya pe rahmat ban kar chhaya<br> duniya ko tune deen sikhaya<br> rang o zaba'n ka fark mitaya<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>To khe khuda mehbub banayo<br> saare jaha'n teya tohenjo saayo<br> bande khe tu khaliq sa milayo<br> noor sa tu aalam chamkayo<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>Jad wi nawa tera sohna naawa<br> rabb de lakh lakh shukr manawa<br> kar de karam tere roze te aawa<br> dar te tere muk jawan saawa<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>ta be saharo ta sahara ye<br> ta aajizano ta mojiza ye<br> ta mo'mina no mushkil kusha ye<br> ta musalmano hajat rawa ye<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>Ya rasoolallah tayi azmat<br> ya nabi tayi shano shaukat<br> duniya e wasta raaye jannat<br> har chi na manni ruwa dozakh<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>Ya mustafa stot kha yari byala<br> thob na michoq po stongsa nayala<br> goqse shukur yang schos pi khudala<br> dena salam yang rchoks po khujala<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>Ba labe muslim isme mustafa ast<br> misle shuma az jahan kuja ast<br> noor e shuma az jahaan dar jahaan<br> khilqat e alam baraye shuma ast<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
  <p>Anta za'eem e jamee'al ambiya<br> anta habeeballah ya mustafa<br> wa anta noorullah ya mujtaba<br> anta muzammil wa anta taaha<br> tujhko pukare har zaba'n..</p> 
